Please note that this is a simplified example and does not include advanced features like network access, robust error handling for various failure scenarios, optimization of memory management, support for multiple configuration files, modular design, extensibility, performance considerations, logging mechanism, or dealing with invalid or conflicting environment variable names. These aspects would require additional code and careful consideration based on the specific requirements and constraints of your project.']

